1
00:00:00,352 --> 00:00:01,522
(Sheldon:)Because it's a hub.

2
00:00:03,922 --> 00:00:05,422
(Amy:)Sheldon, can I come in?

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:06,690
(Sheldon:)-Do you have cookies?
-No.

4
00:00:06,858 --> 00:00:08,458
(Sheldon:)Good. I don't deserve cookies.
Come in.

5
00:00:11,463 --> 00:00:12,303
(Sheldon:)Wil?

6
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:13,844
(Wil Wheaton:)Hey, Sheldon.
It's been a while.

7
00:00:13,999 --> 00:00:15,209
(Sheldon:)Why are you here?

8
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:16,867
(Wil:)Amy said you were
having a rough time,

9
00:00:17,035 --> 00:00:18,105
(Wil:)and I thought maybe we could talk.

10
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,540
(Wil:)Is that okay?

11
00:00:19,805 --> 00:00:21,445
(Sheldon:)Certainly.

12
00:00:21,606 --> 00:00:23,346
(Sheldon:)Although... right now,
I'm having a rough time

13
00:00:23,475 --> 00:00:25,715
(Sheldon:)because there's
three people in my room,

14
00:00:25,877 --> 00:00:27,517
and its starting to feel
like a discotheque.

15
00:00:29,314 --> 00:00:31,354
(Amy:)Sheldon, you said you were
unhappy getting attention

16
00:00:31,516 --> 00:00:33,626
(Amy:)for something you wished
you never did.

17
00:00:33,785 --> 00:00:35,455
(Wil:)Yeah, I know a little
something about that.

18
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,530
(Sheldon:)Oh, nonsense, Wil.

19
00:00:37,689 --> 00:00:40,569
(Sheldon:)Your endless tweets
are not that bad.

20
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,670
(Wil:)I remember why it's been a while.

21
00:00:45,063 --> 00:00:46,133
(Wil:)Sheldon, I was actually talking

22
00:00:46,298 --> 00:00:47,678
(Wil:)about when I was a kid on Star Trek.

23
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,180
(Sheldon:)How could you not
like getting attention

24
00:00:50,335 --> 00:00:51,675
(Sheldon:)for playing Wesley Crusher?

25
00:00:51,837 --> 00:00:53,747
(Sheldon:)You were wonderful.

26
00:00:53,905 --> 00:00:57,355
(Sheldon:)A know-it-all boy genius
with an eidetic memory.

27
00:00:57,509 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)Who couldn't relate to that?

